ection><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/5Cgn8ba2wdNWwk0ppV31PagaYoTPZVO02icA1eibNuN3JNT24PSlg68cYl4MM2wqKcVKzp9Yt2zHdCbqcX95fyQw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>近日，国务院学位委员会公布了2024年度学位授权自主审核单位增设的学位授予点名单，北京理工大学“船舶与海洋工程”博士学位授权一级学科点成功获批。该点由北京理工大学珠海校区牵头建设，是学校主动服务国家海洋强国战略、充分发挥京珠两地协同联动优势、深入落实立德树人根本任务的战略谋划与前瞻布局，主要研究方向包括船舶与海洋结构物设计制造、海洋智能与无人技术、水声工程。</span></span></p><p><span><span>欢<span>迎船舶与海洋工程、力学、机械、自动化、人工智能等相关专业</span>的优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读珠海校区船舶与海洋工程、船舶工程研究生！</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><b><span>一、招生专业及类别</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5Cgn8ba2wdNgadlb4qficvFkHziapTKSFwJic9KJsYa3YjOjxutvs0ZlmwwPGeicuJqer3QzytgxZxQiclE5MH2SfhA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5Cgn8ba2wdNWwk0ppV31PagaYoTPZVO07eMcNu4lLib1KRcc4uibTxQRC0NvxZAAwr96a4o7MeKjT7IibZlZiaKp2w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>二、申请条件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5Cgn8ba2wdNWwk0ppV31PagaYoTPZVO07eMcNu4lLib1KRcc4uibTxQRC0NvxZAAwr96a4o7MeKjT7IibZlZiaKp2w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务；品德良好，遵纪守法。</span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span>2.学习期间未受过任何处分。身心健康，符合国家和招生单位规定的体检要求。</span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span>3.已获得所在高校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span>4.勤奋好学，思维敏捷，专业基础知识扎实，具有较强的实践能力和创新能力。</span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span>5.本科期间在核心期刊及以上学术刊物发表论文或获科研成果奖或在全国高水平科技竞赛中获奖者优先考虑。</span></font></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5Cgn8ba2wdNWwk0ppV31PagaYoTPZVO07eMcNu4lLib1KRcc4uibTxQRC0NvxZAAwr96a4o7MeKjT7IibZlZiaKp2w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>三、申请程序</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5Cgn8ba2wdNWwk0ppV31PagaYoTPZVO07eMcNu4lLib1KRcc4uibTxQRC0NvxZAAwr96a4o7MeKjT7IibZlZiaKp2w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.</span></span><b><span></span></b><span><b><span><font><span>报名时间</span></font></span></b></span></p><p><span><b><span><font><span>即日起至</span></font><font><span>9月1</span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span>6</span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span>日24：00</span></font></span></b></span></p><p><span><b><span><font><span>2</span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span>.</span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span>报名方式</span></font></span></b><span><font><span><br/></span></font></span></span></p><p><span><span><font><span>请扫描下方二维码报名（</span></font></span><b><span><font><span>请先扫描二维码报名，然后提交个人材料，二者缺一认定为报名不成功）</span></font></span></b><span><font><span>。</span></font></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/5Cgn8ba2wdNgadlb4qficvFkHziapTKSFw5tNlHLY2ib9odxFp67hcKc9KUROrxhacuRodsY2nbn44OzYFd6Wm9iaQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span><span><font><span><br/></span></font></span></span></p><p><span><span><font><span><span>3.</span></span></font></span><b><span><font><span>提交材料</span></font></span></b></span></p><p><span><b><span><font><span><span>(1)</span></span></font></span></b><span><font><span>有效期内的学生证、身份证原件及扫描件（提交扫描件，复试时出示原件）。</span></font></span></span></p><p><span><span><font><span>(2)</span></font></span><span><font><span>加盖</span></font></span><span><font><span>所在高校</span></font></span><span><font><span>教务处公章的本科成绩单原件（成绩单上的章应为红色）。</span></font></span></span></p><p><span><span><font><span>(3)</span></font></span><span><font><span>获奖证书</span></font></span><span><font><span>复印</span></font></span><span><font><span>件。</span></font></span></span></p><p><span><span><font><span>(4)</span></font></span><span><font><span>其他体现学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物、专利证书或具有学术水平工作成果的</span></font></span><span><font><span>复印</span></font></span><span><font><span>件或证明。</span></font></span></span></p><p><span><span><font><span>(5)</span></font></span><span><font><span>申请本直博的考生除提交以上材料外，还须于复试时线下提交：《北京理工大学</span></font><font><span>2026年招收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书》（附件1）一式两份，推荐人须为2名具有副教授及以上职称的专家，推荐书应由推荐人密封并在封口处签字。</span></font></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><font><span>请在报名截止日期前将以上材料按顺序扫描成</span></font><font><span>1个PDF文件（不大于20M），发送至</span></font></span><span><font><span>珠海校区</span></font></span><span><font><span>邮箱</span></font></span><b><span><font><span>yjszs@bitzh.edu.cn</span></font></span></b><span><font><span>。邮件名称和附件名称请</span></font></span><b><span><font><span>统一命名为：报考专业</span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span>代码</span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span>-报考专业</span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span>名称</span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span>-报考方向-本人姓名</span></font></span></b><span><font><span>（例：</span></font></span><span><font><span>082400</span></font></span><span><font><span>-</span></font></span><span><font><span>船舶与海洋工程</span></font></span><span><font><span>-</span></font></span><span><font><span>0</span></font></span><span><font><span>3</span></font></span><span><font><span>-</span></font></span><span><font><span>水声工程-XXX</span></font></span><span><font><span>）</span></font></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><font><span><span>4</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>.复试</span></span></font></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span>珠海校区根据申请情况，对申请人提交的材料进行评审，审核通过后，由专人通知申请人考核时间和具体要求。</span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>即日起，考生可通过电话或邮件向珠海校区咨询。</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：0756-3622551</span></p><p><span>咨询邮件：yjszs@bitzh.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eXyUOHm6UtpYl_xC-uhFKw?scene=1&amp;click_id=19\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1.北京理工大学2026年招收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书.doc</a></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5Cgn8ba2wdNWwk0ppV31PagaYoTPZVO07eMcNu4lLib1KRcc4uibTxQRC0NvxZAAwr96a4o7MeKjT7IibZlZiaKp2w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><